OL,3,GNEWSAActor says AI voice clone campaign
OL,4,Awon support fast
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn actor leading a campaign for greater
OL,7,Fprotection against artificial
OL,8,Fintelligence voice cloning has warned
OL,9,Fthe voice industry is "facing an
OL,10,Fexistential threat".
OL,12,FPeter Caulfield, who stars in Channel
OL,13,F4's drama Tip Toe, said it did not take
OL,14,Flong to get support from high-profile
OL,15,Fstars including Downton Abbey actor
OL,16,FHugh Bonneville and Derry Girls actress
OL,17,FNicola Coughlan.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
