OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1788693933
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAActor says AI voice clone campaign
OL,4,Awon support fast
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis petition has more than 4,000
OL,7,Fsignatures, with the government
OL,8,Fannouncing a consultation on how to
OL,9,F"address these harms, while protecting
OL,10,Flegitimate innovation".
OL,12,FCaulfield, who grew up in Mapperley,
OL,13,FNottinghamshire, said: "People were
OL,14,Fgenuinely wanting to get involved and
OL,15,Fwanting to engage."
